{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='src/main.js';s=open(p).read();s=s.replace('nativeResume();','nativeResume();app.audio.suspend?.(false);');s=s.replace(\\\"const s=app.state,b=board();if(\"'!s\", \"const s=app.state,b=board();app.observing=!!b&&b.claim!==seat();if(!s\");open(p,'\"'w').write(s)\np='../PROGRESS.md';s=open(p).read();s+='\\\\n## Integrated implementation\\\\n- Full native engine v0.89.1 and official Hub 1.4.0 client vendored; revisions match PLAN references.\\\\n- Source manual/history/screenshot inspected; ledger at docs/research.md.\\\\n- Pure simulation, training plus three cases, stencil solver/validator, repair hazards, votes, seeded retries implemented. Simulation suite currently 1,739 passing assertions.\\\\n- Native city/workbench art, original native shapes/rigs/tool animations, procedural sound and formant voices implemented. Actual music bus default 0.1 verified.\\\\n- Real standalone PeerJS Cloud host/join, repair, win, disconnect/rejoin and negative room paths tested (19 checks). Official Hub harness passed normal, four-seat lag/loss, host-leave, server authority scenarios. Final artifact rerun underway.\\\\n- Main native Shell menus, custom readable HUD, tool controls, editor/dev sliders, campaign/save/results, credits, attract playlist integrated. Initial root single HTML builds and loads on file URL without errors.\\\\n- Reviewed title/workbench at 1920×1080; screenshots in evidence/.\\\\n\\\\n## Active work / ownership\\\\n- Root: main/UI integration, browser controller/touch/pause/editor/attract verification, packaging, report.\\\\n- simulation agent: ordinary-input whole campaign browser driver and model tests/docs.\\\\n- network agent: final-artifact official Hub and real standalone UI checks.\\\\n- art_audio agent: final-artifact native art/audio checks.\\\\n\\\\n## Remaining\\\\n- Resolve browser integration defects; run all verification groups through node tools/verify.mjs.\\\\n- Complete truthful exit-interview.json and embedded credits from same data, rebuild and final artifact checks.\\\\n- Update issue ledger, progress, final deliverable/feedback links.\\\\n';open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode tools/build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
