{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_43","type":"agent_message","text":"The title and workbench now render with the native pixel dioramas and large work orders. Browser testing caught a transition bug after the first disposal: closing the confirmation could return to the title before results appeared. I’m fixing that and checking the remaining campaign, controller, touch, pause, editor, and network flows.\n"}}
