{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_66","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"mkdir -p vendor/engine-docs; cp vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/README.md vendor/engine-docs/README.md; cp vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/API.md vendor/engine-docs/API.md; cp vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/API-INDEX.md vendor/engine-docs/API-INDEX.md; cp vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/AI_GUIDE.md vendor/engine-docs/AI_GUIDE.md; cp vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/docs/ASSETS.md vendor/engine-docs/ASSETS.md; cp vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/pointclick.js vendor/engine-docs/pointclick-kit.js; cp vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/kits/adventure.js vendor/engine-docs/adventure-kit.js\npython3 - <<'PY'\np='tests/art-headless.mjs';s=open(p).read().replace('vendor/engine-repo/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js','vendor/my-3d2dge.js');open(p,'w').write(s)\np='docs/research.md';s=open(p).read().replace('Third-party software is MIT licensed; notices retained under vendor and in the final HTML.','The engine and PeerJS carry MIT licenses, retained under vendor and in the final HTML. The Hub client is included unmodified as its official integration protocol prescribes; a separate Hub license is unknown.');open(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ncat > vendor/DEPENDENCIES.md <<'EOF'\n# Vendored dependencies\n\n- \"'`my-3d2dge.js`: full my-3D2dge handoff v0.89.1, fetched from `michaelcrosato/my-3d2dge`, revision `8ecc2f62353761187bdfe226f327b7ea5d2eb691`. Unmodified source; MIT license in ENGINE-LICENSE. Documentation and inspected pointclick/adventure examples are retained in engine-docs/.\n- `hub/`: official lib/hub README, client, bridge, round and harness from `michaelcrosato/ai-hub`, revision `35a1047f2067b2af3de3943f0fe452f39105d869`; session client1.4.0/protocol1. The client is byte-for-byte first script in the output. Separate license unknown; original notice retained.\n- `peerjs.min.js`: PeerJS1.5.5 official distribution, MIT notice in PEERJS-LICENSE. Loaded inline without making a connection; instantiated only after standalone Host/Join.\n\nNo runtime solo dependencies are downloaded. Standalone rooms intentionally use the pinned client'\"'s secure PeerJS Cloud signaling and WebRTC. The game contains no audio files or raster artwork files.\nEOF\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport pathlib,shutil\nfor name in ['hub-repo','engine-repo']:\n p=pathlib.Path('vendor')/name\n assert p.resolve().parent==pathlib.Path('vendor').resolve()\n shutil.rmtree(p)\nPY\nbiome check --write --unsafe src/main.js src/ui/style.css tools/build.mjs tools/verify.mjs > evidence/biome-root.log 2>&1\nruff check --fix tests/*.py > evidence/ruff.log 2>&1\nruff format tests/*.py >> evidence/ruff.log 2>&1\nnode --check src/main.js\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
