{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_127","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,hashlib,re\nroot=Path.cwd();project=json.loads((root/'project.json').read_text());build=json.loads((root/'evidence/build.json').read_text());verify=json.loads((root/'evidence/verification.json').read_text());report=json.loads((root.parent/'exit-interview.json').read_text());artifact=root.parent/(project['slug']+'.html');html=artifact.read_text();raw=artifact.read_bytes()\nassert verify['groups']==['all'] and verify['checks']==2498 and not verify['failures']\nassert hashlib.sha256(raw).hexdigest()==build['sha256']\nassert json.loads(re.search(r'BU\\\\.REPORT=([\\\\s\\\\S]*?);</script>',html).group(1))==report\nassert re.search(r'<script>([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)</script>',html).group(1)==(root/'vendor/hub/session.js').read_text()\nassert len(list(root.parent.glob('*.html')))==1\nassert report['sourceInformation']['usage']=='added on import'\nassert (len(report['testingFeedback']),len(report['engineFeedback']),len(report['promptFeedback']))==(4,6,4)\nassert len(set(re.findall(r'\"'^'\"\\\\| ((?:SIM|UI|NET|AUDIO|ART|TOUCH|STYLE|CREDITS|DEV)-\\\\d+) \\\\|',(root/'docs/testing.md').read_text(),re.M)))==22\ncampaign=json.loads((root/'evidence/campaign-browser.json').read_text());assert campaign['sha256']==build['sha256'] and not campaign['failures']\nsummary={\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"title\\\":project['title'],\\\"artifact\\\":artifact.name,\\\"sha256\\\":build['sha256'],\\\"bytes\\\":len(raw),\\\"checks\\\":verify['checks'],\\\"failures\\\":0,\\\"campaignChecks\\\":campaign['checks'],\\\"campaignActions\\\":campaign['actions'],\\\"fixedGameIssues\\\":22,\\\"criticalGameIssuesFixed\\\":3,\\\"engineChanges\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"physicalHardwareListening\\\":\\\"unknown\\\",\\\"crossNetworkNat\\\":\\\"unknown\\\"}\n(root/'evidence/final-summary.json').write_text(json.dumps(summary,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nprogress=f'''# Progress — COMPLETE\n\nGame: **Bomb Union**\nDevelopment folder: \"'`{project['\"'slug']}\"'`\nDelivered HTML: `{artifact.name}`\nRequired report: `exit-interview.json` (root, beside HTML)\nPlan / brief: `PLAN.md` / `TASK.md`\n\n## Delivered\n- Guided training and all three complete authored cases: waterfront, power relay, Central Exchange; endings, failure, scoring, seeded retries, replay and case selection.\n- Deterministic repair state machine, ordered two-lead cuts/grip/stock/placement/soldering, fixed shape/color diagnostics, recovery, heat/fire/foam, persistent offscreen hazards, exact stencil evidence and deliberate code submission.\n- Full native my-3D2dge0.89.1 rendering, original components/tools/van/crew/three city dioramas, native rig and tool animations, native controller Shell/settings/rebindings and display-resolution HUD/fuse.\n- Entirely procedural music/effects/gibberish voices; actual music gain default0.1, separate buses, urgent voice/caption priority, pause/end lifecycle.\n- Solo and1–4 cooperative shared authority: official Hub protocol1/client1.4.0, standalone PeerJS1.5.5 Cloud/WebRTC host/join, claims, snapshots, shared evidence, votes, disconnect/rejoin and host departure.\n- Keyboard/mouse, standard-mapped pad and assisted touch; responsive portrait PCB and safe contextual action; meaningful Back/pause/custom-panel restoration.\n- Pause-accessible live host tuning, solo checkpoint/step/editor, inspection and fault tools, versioned JSON import/export/playtest, settings reset and modified/assisted result labels.\n- Separate actual-simulation attract playlist after10idle seconds with consumed wake input and no save/network effects.\n- Versioned safe progress/settings, exact exit report,17controller-readable credits pages, preserved third-party notices, research/authoring/controls/network documentation.\n\n## Final verification\n`node tools/verify.mjs` completed: **2,498 checks,0failures**.\nAll groups: sim, net, browser, campaign, audio, peer, touch, controller, hub, package.\nThe ordinary player-facing campaign passed508checks /273UIactions through training and all three cases, including recovery, wrong replacement, diagnosis, fire and inferred final codes. Its recorded artifact hash matches the final export.\nReal cloud-signaled two-page cooperation and exported host/join/repair/vote/win flows passed. Official Hub normal,4-player latency150/jitter50/loss5, host-leave and authority-only server scenarios passed with canonical state agreement.\nNative rendering, audio graph/defaults, finite/unclipped offline synthesis, full pad-only disposal, touch repairs/foam/testing, credits fit, editor, attract, storage recovery and packaging passed.\nBiome and Ruff checks are clean.22unique game defects were fixed,3critical; `docs/testing.md` has evidence and regressions. Test-fixture corrections are distinguished from game defects.\n\nFinal HTML bytes: {len(raw):,}\nSHA-256: `{build['\"'sha256']}\"'`\nOfficial first Hub script is byte-for-byte identical to vendor. Embedded report deep-equals root JSON. Only one root HTML is delivered and it contains all runtime dependencies and notices.\n\n## Versions and records\nEngine revision:8ecc2f62353761187bdfe226f327b7ea5d2eb691 (full0.89.1); engine changes:none.\nHub revision:35a1047f2067b2af3de3943f0fe452f39105d869 (client1.4.0/protocol1).\nPeerJS1.5.5. Chromium153 / Playwright1.63; pad, phone/tablet checks are emulated.\nSee `evidence/final-summary.json`, `verification.json`, `build.json`, `campaign-browser.json` and network/audio records.\n\n## Boundaries\nPhysical controller/touch/TV, listening quality, first-time human pacing and universal cross-network NAT reachability are unknown. Two same-machine pages exercised the real shipped secure cloud-signaling path; no TURN credentials are invented.\nNo required implementation or verification work remains. All browsers/HTTP fixtures owned by completed tests were closed. Large temporary repository clones and source research caches were removed after preserving required runtime/docs/notices and the linked research ledger.\n'\"'''\n(root.parent/'PROGRESS.md').write_text(progress)\nwith (root/'docs/testing.md').open('a')as f:f.write(f'\\\\n## Final acceptance\\\\n\\\\nThe final exported artifact passed **{verify[\\\"checks\\\"]:,} checks, zero failures**, through the single verification command. Final SHA-256: \"'`{build[\"sha256\"]}`. The fresh ordinary-input campaign recorded508checks/273actions against these exact bytes. There are22unique fixed game issue IDs, including3critical defects; harness/locator precision corrections are not counted as game defects. All17metadata/feedback pages fit the controller-readable viewport. Full summary: `evidence/final-summary.json`.'\"\\\\n')\nprint(json.dumps(summary,indent=2))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
